<h3>Afternoon — Lunch and the Pleasure of Doing Less</h3>
<p>By early afternoon, you'll probably be ready for lunch.</p>
<p>Lulu California Bistro, located along Palm Canyon Drive, offers a convenient downtown setting and a varied menu.</p>
<p>Then comes one of the most enjoyable parts of a Palm Springs weekend: returning to your hotel and doing very little.</p>
<p>In some destinations, spending an afternoon beside the hotel pool might feel like missing something.</p>
<p>In Palm Springs, it can feel like you've discovered exactly why people have been coming here for generations.</p>
<p>With the mountains rising beyond the palms and the afternoon stretching ahead, there's something appealing about having absolutely nowhere else you need to be.</p>
<figure class="destination-photo"><img alt="Palm Springs poolside" loading="lazy" src="/images/palm-springs-poolside.webp"/></figure>
<p><em>Caption: Sunshine, swimming pools, and an unhurried afternoon capture the playful spirit of a desert getaway.</em></p>
